			{
				"description" : "Restoring all mana at the beginning of day and increasing magic damage by 5% per level. Increasing cast amount of commander 10% per level. Removing all magic resistance abilities and immune mana effects from all enemy armies . As a trade-off, starting with basic mysticism and basic learning skills, and can not gain spell power and knowledge when leveling up. ",
